[gd_scene load_steps=16 format=3]

; zone_catacombs — the Demon Tower (WLD-07; rebuilt 2026-09-23), band 19–23. The zone keeps its
; id so saves and the last quest keep working; everything the player sees calls it the tower.
;
; Nine floors, one footprint: the same forty-metre hall at each level, stacked twenty-four metres
; apart, only the occupied one awake. Red and dark-purple flagstones, dungeon walls with a tower
; at each corner, braziers burning red into violet. Zombies hold the lower floors and demons the
; upper; the dressing follows — coffins and bones below, chains and cages above, and the top
; floor is the Demon Lord's throne room in a ring of fire.
;
; What lives here is only what data cannot hold: where the player lands, where the stair is,
; where a target may stand and where a wave walks in. What each floor asks is in
; game/data/zones/act1.json. Generated by a script; edit the script, not this file.

